{"id":"torrey:inspiration-of-the-holy-spirit-the","source":"torrey","name":"Inspiration Of The Holy Spirit, The","slug":"inspiration-of-the-holy-spirit-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Foretold — Joe 2:28; Ac 2:16-18.","refs":[["Joel",2,28,2,28],["Acts",2,16,2,18]]},{"text":"All Scripture given by — 2Sa 23:2; 2Ti 3:16; 2Pe 1:21.","refs":[["2Sam",23,2,23,2],["2Tim",3,16,3,16],["2Pet",1,21,1,21]]},{"text":"To reveal future events. — Ac 1:16; 28:25; 1Pe 1:11.","refs":[["Acts",1,16,1,16],["Acts",28,25,28,25],["1Pet",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"To reveal the mysteries of God. — Am 3:7; 1Co 2:10.","refs":[["Amos",3,7,3,7],["1Cor",2,10,2,10]]},{"text":"To give power to ministers. — Mic 3:8; Ac 1:8.","refs":[["Mic",3,8,3,8],["Acts",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"To direct ministers. — Eze 3:24-27; Ac 11:12; 13:2.","refs":[["Ezek",3,24,3,27],["Acts",11,12,11,12],["Acts",13,2,13,2]]},{"text":"To control ministers. — Ac 16:6.","refs":[["Acts",16,6,16,6]]},{"text":"To testify against sin. — 2Ki 17:13; Ne 9:30; Mic 3:8; Joh 16:8,9.","refs":[["2Kgs",17,13,17,13],["Neh",9,30,9,30],["Mic",3,8,3,8],["John",16,8,16,8],["John",16,9,16,9]]},{"text":"Various. — Heb 1:1.","refs":[["Heb",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"By secret impulse. — Jdj 13:25; 2Pe 1:21.","refs":[["Judg",13,25,13,25],["2Pet",1,21,1,21]]},{"text":"By a voice. — Isa 6:8; Ac 8:29; Re 1:10.","refs":[["Isa",6,8,6,8],["Acts",8,29,8,29],["Rev",1,10,1,10]]},{"text":"By visions. — Nu 12:6; Eze 11:24.","refs":[["Num",12,6,12,6],["Ezek",11,24,11,24]]},{"text":"By dreams. — Nu 12:6; Da 7:1.","refs":[["Num",12,6,12,6],["Dan",7,1,7,1]]},{"text":"Necessary to prophesying — Nu 11:25-27; 2Ch 20:14-17.","refs":[["Num",11,25,11,27],["2Chr",20,14,20,17]]},{"text":"Is irresistible — Am 3:8.","refs":[["Amos",3,8,3,8]]},{"text":"Despisers of, punished — 2Ch 36:15,16; Zec 7:12.","refs":[["2Chr",36,15,36,15],["2Chr",36,16,36,16],["Zech",7,12,7,12]]}],"refCount":37}
